OL,3,GNEWSACricket star Botham joins wind
OL,4,Afarm protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer England cricketer Lord Ian
OL,7,FBotham is set to join a protest walk
OL,8,Fagainst plans for a wind farm on
OL,9,Fmoorland near the Yorkshire Dales.
OL,11,FCampaigners opposing the proposed Hope
OL,12,FMoor development on land between
OL,13,FArkengarthdale and Teesdale say 23
OL,14,Fturbines more than 656ft (200m) high
OL,15,Fwould harm a nationally important
OL,16,Flandscape.
OL,18,FDeveloper Fred. Olsen Renewables argues
OL,19,Fthe scheme could generate enough
OL,20,Frenewable electricity to power about
OL,21,F135,000 homes while helping meet
OL,22,Fclimate targets.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
