OL,3,GNEWSACricket star Botham joins wind
OL,4,Afarm protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Botham, who lives near Richmond,
OL,7,Fis due to take part in a walk across
OL,8,FBarningham Moor organised by opponents
OL,9,Fon 11 October.
